{"seq":3,"slug":"replication-and-partitioning","title":"复制与分区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/distributed-systems/replication-and-partitioning","wordCount":815,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"复制与分区\">复制与分区</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复制与分区是分布式存储的两个正交维度——前者解决「数据不丢、读得更快」，后者解决「单机装不下」。本篇的几个基础概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>复制的价值</strong>：提升可用性（节点故障不丢数据）、降低读取延迟（就近读）、提升读吞吐量（副本分担读）。</li>\n<li><strong>同步 vs 异步复制</strong>：同步复制强一致但写延迟高、任一副本故障影响写入；异步复制延迟低但主节点故障可能丢数据；半同步是折中（至少等一个副本确认）。</li>\n<li><strong>复制拓扑</strong>：单主（无写入冲突，如 MySQL）、多主（有冲突，如 CockroachDB）、无主（任意节点可写，如 Cassandra、DynamoDB）。</li>\n<li><strong>分区策略</strong>：范围分区范围查询高效但易生热点；哈希分区分布均匀但不支持高效范围查询；复合分区兼顾两者但实现复杂。</li>\n<li><strong>组合使用</strong>：实际系统同时使用复制与分区——每个分区多个副本（Leader + Follower），这是 Kafka、Cassandra、MongoDB 的标准架构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据复制\">数据复制</h2><p>数据复制（Replication）是将同一份数据存储在多个节点上的策略。它的核心目标是：提升数据可用性（节点故障时不丢数据）、降低读取延迟（从最近的副本读取）、提升读吞吐量（多个副本分担读请求）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; Primary[(主节点)]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R1[(副本 1)]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R2[(副本 2)]&#10;    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R3[(副本 3)]\">flowchart TB\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; Primary[(主节点)]\n    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R1[(副本 1)]\n    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R2[(副本 2)]\n    Primary --&gt;|同步/异步复制| R3[(副本 3)]</pre><h3 id=\"同步复制-vs-异步复制\">同步复制 vs 异步复制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant P as 主节点&#10;    participant R1 as 副本 1&#10;    participant R2 as 副本 2&#10;&#10;    Note over C,R2: 同步复制&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P: 写入数据&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;R1: 同步复制&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;R2: 同步复制&#10;    R1--&gt;&gt;P: 确认&#10;    R2--&gt;&gt;P: 确认&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;C: 写入成功&#10;    Note over P: 所有副本都写入后才返回&#10;&#10;    Note over C,R2: 异步复制&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;P: 写入数据&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;C: 写入成功(立即返回)&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;R1: 异步复制&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;R2: 异步复制&#10;    Note over P: 先返回再复制\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant P as 主节点\n    participant R1 as 副本 1\n    participant R2 as 副本 2\n\n    Note over C,R2: 同步复制\n    C-&gt;&gt;P: 写入数据\n    P-&gt;&gt;R1: 同步复制\n    P-&gt;&gt;R2: 同步复制\n    R1--&gt;&gt;P: 确认\n    R2--&gt;&gt;P: 确认\n    P--&gt;&gt;C: 写入成功\n    Note over P: 所有副本都写入后才返回\n\n    Note over C,R2: 异步复制\n    C-&gt;&gt;P: 写入数据\n    P--&gt;&gt;C: 写入成功(立即返回)\n    P-&gt;&gt;R1: 异步复制\n    P-&gt;&gt;R2: 异步复制\n    Note over P: 先返回再复制</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>同步复制</th>\n<th>异步复制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入延迟</td>\n<td>高（等待所有副本确认）</td>\n<td>低（立即返回）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据安全</td>\n<td>无数据丢失风险</td>\n<td>主节点故障可能丢失数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>较低（任一副本故障影响写入）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"半同步复制\">半同步复制</h3><p>实践中的折中方案——至少等待一个副本确认，其余异步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ReplicationConfig {&#10;  totalReplicas: number;&#10;  syncReplicas: number;&#10;  asyncReplicas: number;&#10;  writeTimeout: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function writeWithSemiSync(&#10;  primary: Node,&#10;  replicas: Node[],&#10;  data: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;,&#10;  config: ReplicationConfig,&#10;): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;  await primary.write(data);&#10;&#10;  const syncPromises = replicas.slice(0, config.syncReplicas).map((r) =&gt; r.write(data));&#10;&#10;  const asyncReplicas = replicas.slice(config.syncReplicas);&#10;  asyncReplicas.forEach((r) =&gt; r.write(data).catch(() =&gt; {}));&#10;&#10;  const results = await Promise.allSettled(syncPromises);&#10;  const successCount = results.filter((r) =&gt; r.status === &#39;fulfilled&#39;).length;&#10;&#10;  return successCount &gt;= 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Node {&#10;  write(data: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReplicationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  syncReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  asyncReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  writeTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> writeWithSemiSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  primary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReplicationConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> primary.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> syncPromises</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replicas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, config.syncReplicas).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> asyncReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replicas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.syncReplicas);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  asyncReplicas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allSettled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(syncPromises);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> successCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fulfilled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D