<td>范围查询高效</td>\n<td>容易产生热点</td>\n<td>时间序列、字母排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希分区</td>\n<td>数据分布均匀</td>\n<td>不支持高效范围查询</td>\n<td>键值查询为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合分区</td>\n<td>兼顾两者优势</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n<td>复杂查询需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"复制-分区\">复制 + 分区</h2><p>实际系统中，复制和分区通常<strong>同时使用</strong>——每个分区都有多个副本：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client[客户端] --&gt; Router[路由层]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Partition0[分区 0]&#10;        P0_L[(Leader)]&#10;        P0_F1[(Follower)]&#10;        P0_F2[(Follower)]&#10;        P0_L --&gt; P0_F1&#10;        P0_L --&gt; P0_F2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Partition1[分区 1]&#10;        P1_L[(Leader)]&#10;        P1_F1[(Follower)]&#10;        P1_F2[(Follower)]&#10;        P1_L --&gt; P1_F1&#10;        P1_L --&gt; P1_F2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Router --&gt; P0_L&#10;    Router --&gt; P1_L\">flowchart TB\n    Client[客户端] --&gt; Router[路由层]\n\n    subgraph Partition0[分区 0]\n        P0_L[(Leader)]\n        P0_F1[(Follower)]\n        P0_F2[(Follower)]\n        P0_L --&gt; P0_F1\n        P0_L --&gt; P0_F2\n    end\n\n    subgraph Partition1[分区 1]\n        P1_L[(Leader)]\n        P1_F1[(Follower)]\n        P1_F2[(Follower)]\n        P1_L --&gt; P1_F1\n        P1_L --&gt; P1_F2\n    end\n\n    Router --&gt; P0_L\n    Router --&gt; P1_L</pre><p>这是 Kafka、Cassandra、MongoDB 等分布式系统的标准架构模式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"热点问题与再平衡\">热点问题与再平衡</h2><h3 id=\"热点检测与处理\">热点检测与处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PartitionMetrics {&#10;  partitionId: number;&#10;  requestRate: number;&#10;  dataSize: number;&#10;  cpuUsage: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function detectHotspot(metrics: PartitionMetrics[], threshold: number): PartitionMetrics[] {&#10;  const avgRate = metrics.reduce((sum, m) =&gt; sum + m.requestRate, 0) / metrics.length;&#10;  return metrics.filter((m) =&gt; m.requestRate &gt; avgRate * threshold);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rebalancePlan(&#10;  hotPartitions: PartitionMetrics[],&#10;  allPartitions: PartitionMetrics[],&#10;): Array&lt;{ from: number; to: number; keyRange: string }&gt; {&#10;  const coldPartitions = allPartitions&#10;    .filter((p) =&gt; !hotPartitions.includes(p))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; a.requestRate - b.requestRate);&#10;&#10;  return hotPartitions.map((hot, i) =&gt; ({&#10;    from: hot.partitionId,&#10;    to: coldPartitions[i % coldPartitions.length].partitionId,&#10;    keyRange: `split_${hot.partitionId}`,&#10;  }));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PartitionMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  partitionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requestRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dataSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cpuUsage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span styl